[
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.040",
    "end": "00:00:03.270",
    "text": "a lot of people don't realize"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.280",
    "end": "00:00:05.590",
    "text": "how oxygen really works with a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.600",
    "end": "00:00:07.670",
    "text": "mitochondria and it's amazing to me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.680",
    "end": "00:00:09.430",
    "text": "some of the people in fact that you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.440",
    "end": "00:00:10.709",
    "text": "mentioned that you already had on your"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.719",
    "end": "00:00:11.270",
    "text": "show"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.280",
    "end": "00:00:13.190",
    "text": "some of those people don't know what i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.200",
    "end": "00:00:14.870",
    "text": "just told you but yet"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.880",
    "end": "00:00:17.830",
    "text": "they're very smart people and they know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.840",
    "end": "00:00:19.269",
    "text": "a lot of different things but"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.279",
    "end": "00:00:21.269",
    "text": "because they don't know all the details"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.279",
    "end": "00:00:23.429",
    "text": "they have the false belief that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.439",
    "end": "00:00:26.790",
    "text": "food and exercise can change everything"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.800",
    "end": "00:00:29.189",
    "text": "and it turns out that's not true because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.199",
    "end": "00:00:31.109",
    "text": "the way the whole system works that the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.119",
    "end": "00:00:32.950",
    "text": "whole programming of the system is based"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.960",
    "end": "00:00:33.670",
    "text": "on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.680",
    "end": "00:00:35.510",
    "text": "the fourth book on the shelf behind your"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.520",
    "end": "00:00:36.870",
    "text": "left shoulder"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.880",
    "end": "00:00:38.310",
    "text": "and that's called health and light by"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.320",
    "end": "00:00:40.069",
    "text": "john odd why"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.079",
    "end": "00:00:42.069",
    "text": "because if you don't understand light"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.079",
    "end": "00:00:43.190",
    "text": "and how light"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.200",
    "end": "00:00:46.229",
    "text": "controls the levers in your body"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.239",
    "end": "00:00:50.310",
    "text": "you will never ever ever understand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.320",
    "end": "00:00:52.150",
    "text": "what's in the biochemistry book that all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.160",
    "end": "00:00:53.830",
    "text": "first-year medical students"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.840",
    "end": "00:00:56.150",
    "text": "have to learn and it turns out that's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.160",
    "end": "00:00:56.869",
    "text": "exactly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.879",
    "end": "00:00:59.670",
    "text": "what happened to me i never learned i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.680",
    "end": "00:01:01.590",
    "text": "never learned that cytochrome 1 was a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:01.600",
    "end": "00:01:02.790",
    "text": "fluorophore protein"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.800",
    "end": "00:01:05.189",
    "text": "that absorbed 340 nanometer light i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.199",
    "end": "00:01:05.830",
    "text": "never"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.840",
    "end": "00:01:08.789",
    "text": "learned that cytochrome 2 absorbed more"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.799",
    "end": "00:01:09.590",
    "text": "blue light"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.600",
    "end": "00:01:12.870",
    "text": "because of the type of uh chromophore"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.880",
    "end": "00:01:14.789",
    "text": "that was present there it's a flavin"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.799",
    "end": "00:01:17.670",
    "text": "nucleotide so that was there then i had"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.680",
    "end": "00:01:18.710",
    "text": "no idea"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.720",
    "end": "00:01:21.350",
    "text": "that cytochrome 3 and cytochrome 4 had"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.360",
    "end": "00:01:22.950",
    "text": "red-like chromophores in it couldn't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.960",
    "end": "00:01:24.630",
    "text": "figure out why the hell that was the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.640",
    "end": "00:01:25.590",
    "text": "case"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.600",
    "end": "00:01:27.590",
    "text": "and then after going down this rabbit"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.600",
    "end": "00:01:29.350",
    "text": "hole with sharma"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.360",
    "end": "00:01:32.149",
    "text": "and the papers i saw the pink floyd"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.159",
    "end": "00:01:32.950",
    "text": "album cover"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.960",
    "end": "00:01:34.870",
    "text": "and i saw the seven colors of the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.880",
    "end": "00:01:36.789",
    "text": "spectrum and i was like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.799",
    "end": "00:01:40.149",
    "text": "son of a [&nbsp;__&nbsp;] the answer is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.159",
    "end": "00:01:43.109",
    "text": "actually right in front of my face i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.119",
    "end": "00:01:44.630",
    "text": "started to realize"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.640",
    "end": "00:01:47.350",
    "text": "there is color coding inside the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.360",
    "end": "00:01:49.109",
    "text": "mitochondrial"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.119",
    "end": "00:01:51.910",
    "text": "um membrane and it's staring us right in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.920",
    "end": "00:01:53.990",
    "text": "the face and then"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.000",
    "end": "00:01:56.950",
    "text": "when you go further down the rabbit hole"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.960",
    "end": "00:01:58.630",
    "text": "and this book you don't have behind you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.640",
    "end": "00:02:00.469",
    "text": "at least i can't see it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.479",
    "end": "00:02:03.749",
    "text": "roland van wyck from europe wrote a book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.759",
    "end": "00:02:04.310",
    "text": "about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.320",
    "end": "00:02:07.429",
    "text": "light sculpting life about biophotons"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.439",
    "end": "00:02:10.790",
    "text": "then i found out that every single cell"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.800",
    "end": "00:02:14.070",
    "text": "on this planet releases"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.080",
    "end": "00:02:18.229",
    "text": "uh extreme uh low frequency or"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.239",
    "end": "00:02:21.510",
    "text": "ultra weak biophoton release and i was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.520",
    "end": "00:02:21.990",
    "text": "like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.000",
    "end": "00:02:23.990",
    "text": "stunned i'm like wait you got to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.000",
    "end": "00:02:25.589",
    "text": "kidding me every"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.599",
    "end": "00:02:27.910",
    "text": "single cell releases this how did i not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.920",
    "end": "00:02:29.910",
    "text": "learn this ever in medical school"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.920",
    "end": "00:02:32.710",
    "text": "and when i read the book i realized that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.720",
    "end": "00:02:33.190",
    "text": "this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.200",
    "end": "00:02:36.470",
    "text": "story went back almost 120 years so this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.480",
    "end": "00:02:37.270",
    "text": "isn't like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.280",
    "end": "00:02:39.750",
    "text": "new science this is science that we were"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.760",
    "end": "00:02:40.790",
    "text": "never taught"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.800",
    "end": "00:02:42.790",
    "text": "yeah and there had to be a reason behind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.800",
    "end": "00:02:44.390",
    "text": "it and that reason"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.400",
    "end": "00:02:47.430",
    "text": "actually goes back to um"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.440",
    "end": "00:02:49.830",
    "text": "big pharma in other words we just want"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.840",
    "end": "00:02:51.509",
    "text": "doctors to know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.519",
    "end": "00:02:54.390",
    "text": "how to help heal people through a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.400",
    "end": "00:02:56.550",
    "text": "prescription pad and it turns out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.560",
    "end": "00:02:58.869",
    "text": "that the prescription pad is really good"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.879",
    "end": "00:03:00.630",
    "text": "for a lot of things but"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.640",
    "end": "00:03:02.869",
    "text": "it's really good for big pharma and it's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.879",
    "end": "00:03:03.750",
    "text": "really good for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.760",
    "end": "00:03:06.630",
    "text": "people to keep you in a paradigm to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.640",
    "end": "00:03:08.070",
    "text": "enslave you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.080",
    "end": "00:03:12.070",
    "text": "um it's not good for you to realize"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.080",
    "end": "00:03:14.550",
    "text": "that you may need to not do that learn a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.560",
    "end": "00:03:15.990",
    "text": "little bit of what we're talking about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.000",
    "end": "00:03:16.869",
    "text": "today"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.879",
    "end": "00:03:19.589",
    "text": "so that you can see for yourself that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.599",
    "end": "00:03:21.509",
    "text": "maybe there's a different way"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.519",
    "end": "00:03:23.589",
    "text": "to go about this so that you don't you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.599",
    "end": "00:03:25.350",
    "text": "can rely on yourself your ability to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.360",
    "end": "00:03:26.309",
    "text": "think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.319",
    "end": "00:03:28.949",
    "text": "um and do some of these things and see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.959",
    "end": "00:03:30.710",
    "text": "if you can reverse"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.720",
    "end": "00:03:32.789",
    "text": "one or some of the diseases that you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.799",
    "end": "00:03:34.390",
    "text": "have"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.400",
    "end": "00:03:37.830",
    "text": "and to me that was wildly and powerful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.840",
    "end": "00:03:38.390",
    "text": "because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.400",
    "end": "00:03:40.869",
    "text": "when i was sick as a physician i went to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.879",
    "end": "00:03:41.990",
    "text": "my profession"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.000",
    "end": "00:03:44.710",
    "text": "to try to help me lose weight and i got"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.720",
    "end": "00:03:45.990",
    "text": "told what every other patient"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.000",
    "end": "00:03:48.390",
    "text": "gets told stop eating so much exercise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.400",
    "end": "00:03:49.110",
    "text": "more"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.120",
    "end": "00:03:50.949",
    "text": "i did what the doctors told me and i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.959",
    "end": "00:03:55.360",
    "text": "gained 30 more pounds"
  }
]